= Ogog =

You say, 'i wish to be tested by ogog'
:''Torgon Blademaster says 'Ogog?  You are indeed brave for choosing that brute.  Take this book telling the tale of Ogog and read it.  When you are finished, hand it back to me. ''
:''Torgon Blademaster says 'Farewell. ''
:''Ogog says 'I Ogog, har har. ''
You say, 'hail Ogog'
:''Ogog says 'Ogog not smart, but Ogog smarter than you.  You ready for Ogog or no? ''
You say, 'I am ready for ogog'
:''Ogog says 'Ok.  Ogog got some hard things for you.  You do bash, smash, or think test? ''

